    description: "Found by the 2026-10-31 docstring staleness audit (dev 5f6b2af921): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_10312026/review and verify). Corpus impact not measured. _BLOCK_RE / _OPEN_RE (handlebars.py:58, 62) miss {{~# and a tag whose }} is on the next line, while _CLOSE_RE accepts {{~/; the next close pops the outer block, so scopes (which feed stable ids) are wrong. All reproduced (v11, and the blind re-review b01)."  # 3d63
